  "description": "MemoryPack serializer for CachingFramework.Redis, a distributed caching based on StackExchange.Redis and Redis. Includes support for all redis data types, tagging mechanism, cache invalidation, PubSub, GeoSpatial indexes, HyperLogLog and is cluster-compatible.\n\t\t\tThis uses MemoryPack for C#. You can read more about serialization using MemoryPack in https://github.com/Cysharp/MemoryPack",
